---
import NoteFigure from './NoteFigure.astro';
---

<NoteFigure
  label="Perceptual distance"
  title="Compare the features, then pool the differences"
  caption="An expanded sketch of the algorithm on pages 18–19. Both images use the same pretrained feature network. Each selected layer is normalized across channels, its squared differences are perceptually weighted and spatially averaged, then the layer contributions are summed. Boxes are schematic; no measured features or scores are shown."
>
  <svg class="lpips-wide" viewBox="0 0 780 308" role="img" aria-labelledby="lpips-wide-title lpips-wide-desc">
    <title id="lpips-wide-title">LPIPS compares normalized, weighted feature differences</title>
    <desc id="lpips-wide-desc">Two images, x and x prime, enter the same pretrained convolutional network. Feature maps from multiple layers are normalized across channels at each spatial location. Their squared differences receive learned channel weights. Spatial averages are summed over layers to obtain one LPIPS score. An annotation links human judgments to the learned weights.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="lpips-wide-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" class="ink-arrow" /></marker>
      <marker id="lpips-wide-callout" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" class="accent-arrow" /></marker>
    </defs>
    <g class="step" text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="62" y="28">01 · Image pair</text>
      <text x="211" y="28">02 · Shared network</text>
      <text x="373" y="28">03 · Normalize</text>
      <text x="537" y="28">04 · Compare</text>
      <text x="706" y="28">05 · Reduce</text>
    </g>
    <g class="box">
      <rect x="25" y="70" width="74" height="61" rx="2" />
      <rect x="25" y="153" width="74" height="61" rx="2" />
      <rect x="145" y="84" width="132" height="116" rx="2" />
      <rect x="308" y="84" width="130" height="116" rx="2" />
      <rect x="471" y="84" width="132" height="116" rx="2" />
      <rect x="640" y="84" width="132" height="116" rx="2" />
    </g>
    <g text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="62" y="106" class="variable">x</text>
      <text x="62" y="190" class="variable">x′</text>
      <text x="211" y="125" class="label">Pretrained CNN</text>
      <text x="211" y="150" class="muted-label">several layers ℓ</text>
      <text x="211" y="177" class="variable">φℓ(x), φℓ(x′)</text>
      <text x="373" y="116" class="label">Unit vectors</text>
      <text x="373" y="140" class="muted-label">across channels</text>
      <text x="373" y="164" class="muted-label">at each (h, w)</text>
      <text x="373" y="186" class="variable">φ̂ℓ(x), φ̂ℓ(x′)</text>
      <text x="537" y="111" class="label">Squared</text>
      <text x="537" y="132" class="label">differences</text>
      <text x="537" y="155" class="muted-label">learned weighting</text>
      <text x="537" y="184" class="variable">‖wℓ ⊙ Δφ̂ℓ‖²</text>
      <text x="706" y="115" class="label">Spatial average</text>
      <text x="706" y="143" class="label">+ layer sum</text>
      <text x="706" y="180" class="score">LPIPS(x, x′)</text>
    </g>
    <g class="flow" marker-end="url(#lpips-wide-arrow)">
      <path d="M 104 101 L 140 121" /><path d="M 104 184 L 140 165" />
      <path d="M 282 142 L 303 142" /><path d="M 443 142 L 466 142" /><path d="M 608 142 L 635 142" />
    </g>
    <text x="211" y="229" text-anchor="middle" class="annotation-label">same weights for both inputs</text>
    <path d="M 211 214 L 211 204" class="annotation" marker-end="url(#lpips-wide-callout)" />
    <text x="504" y="267" text-anchor="middle" class="annotation-label">Human judgments teach which differences matter</text>
    <path d="M 537 245 C 560 235 558 219 546 204" class="annotation" marker-end="url(#lpips-wide-callout)" />
    <text x="706" y="294" text-anchor="middle" class="muted-label">lower → closer pair</text>
  </svg>

  <svg class="lpips-narrow" viewBox="0 0 360 710" role="img" aria-labelledby="lpips-narrow-title lpips-narrow-desc">
    <title id="lpips-narrow-title">LPIPS pipeline from an image pair to a perceptual distance</title>
    <desc id="lpips-narrow-desc">Image x and image x prime pass through a shared pretrained network, channel normalization at every spatial location, learned weighting of squared differences, and spatial averaging followed by a layer sum. Human judgments train the channel weighting. A lower output score means a closer image pair in this feature space.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="lpips-narrow-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" class="ink-arrow" /></marker>
      <marker id="lpips-narrow-callout" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" class="accent-arrow" /></marker>
    </defs>
    <g class="box">
      <rect x="65" y="29" width="78" height="58" rx="2" /><rect x="217" y="29" width="78" height="58" rx="2" />
      <rect x="67" y="138" width="226" height="87" rx="2" />
      <rect x="67" y="277" width="226" height="92" rx="2" />
      <rect x="67" y="428" width="226" height="91" rx="2" />
      <rect x="67" y="593" width="226" height="85" rx="2" />
    </g>
    <g text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="180" y="16" class="step">01 · Image pair</text>
      <text x="104" y="65" class="variable">x</text><text x="256" y="65" class="variable">x′</text>
      <text x="180" y="162" class="label">02 · Shared pretrained CNN</text>
      <text x="180" y="185" class="muted-label">same weights · several layers ℓ</text>
      <text x="180" y="211" class="variable">φℓ(x), φℓ(x′)</text>
      <text x="180" y="302" class="label">03 · Channel normalization</text>
      <text x="180" y="327" class="muted-label">unit vector at each location (h, w)</text>
      <text x="180" y="354" class="variable">φ̂ℓ(x), φ̂ℓ(x′)</text>
      <text x="180" y="454" class="label">04 · Squared differences</text>
      <text x="180" y="478" class="muted-label">with learned channel weights</text>
      <text x="180" y="505" class="variable">‖wℓ ⊙ Δφ̂ℓ‖²</text>
      <text x="180" y="617" class="label">05 · Spatial average + layer sum</text>
      <text x="180" y="644" class="score">LPIPS(x, x′)</text>
      <text x="180" y="666" class="muted-label">lower → closer pair</text>
    </g>
    <g class="flow" marker-end="url(#lpips-narrow-arrow)">
      <path d="M 104 93 Q 104 121 164 133" /><path d="M 256 93 Q 256 121 196 133" />
      <path d="M 180 231 L 180 271" /><path d="M 180 375 L 180 422" /><path d="M 180 525 L 180 587" />
    </g>
    <path d="M 305 553 C 344 533 338 492 299 478" class="annotation" marker-end="url(#lpips-narrow-callout)" />
    <rect x="224" y="537" width="99" height="41" class="annotation-background" />
    <text x="273" y="551" text-anchor="middle" class="annotation-label"><tspan x="273">calibrated with</tspan><tspan x="273" dy="19">human judgments</tspan></text>
  </svg>
</NoteFigure>

<style>
  svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .lpips-narrow { display: none; }
  text { fill: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans); }
  .box { fill: var(--paper); stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .label { font-size: 13px; }
  .step, .muted-label { fill: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .variable { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 18px; font-style: italic; }
  .score { fill: var(--accent); font-size: 16px; }
  .flow, .ink-arrow { fill: none; stroke: var(--ink); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .annotation, .accent-arrow { fill: none; stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .annotation-label { fill: var(--accent); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .annotation-background { fill: var(--paper); }
  .lpips-wide .label { font-size: 15px; }
  .lpips-wide .step, .lpips-wide .muted-label, .lpips-wide .annotation-label { font-size: 14px; }
  @container (max-width: 650px) {
    .lpips-wide { display: none; }
    .lpips-narrow { display: block; max-width: 420px; margin-inline: auto; }
  }
</style>
